    "detailed_description": "When you come to your senses, you find yourself trapped in a nightmare. <br>The books scattered around will guide you through your future.<br><br>When the clock chimes, everything around transforms with the darkness.<br>And this place is inhabited by monsters and witches. Escape the nightmare and avoid harm from them.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Game</h2>The Spoiler is an first person escape game infused with psychological horror. <br>You can progress through the story by solving simple puzzles and finding items.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game elements</h2>Simply puzzle, Chasing enemy<br>Include short cut scene<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Option</h2>Graphics settings, Language(KR, EN), Sounds<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control</h2>W A S D is move , Q E is hang up item, SHIFT is run , CTRL is crouch<br>Mouse is rotate camera<br>ESC is open menu<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2>About 30 minutes",
